&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have 5+ years experience in product and project management or deep experience in a related function (eg. analytics, open source)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re excited to balance product innovation with sales-, community- and customer success-driven feedback&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are comfortable discussing, explaining and reasoning about investments in a SaaS platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have experience using or building data tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are an excellent written and verbal communicator&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus&amp;nbsp;Skills&amp;nbsp;(Optional)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You have previous experience working with dbt&lt;/p&gt;
